- Router6 → pc18 works (OUTPUT/INPUT chains — not FORWARD)  
- Router0 → pc18 fails (must traverse FORWARD chain → DROPPED)
- Traceroute: hop 4 (router6) responds, hop 5 (`*`) = packet forwarded but reply blocked

